---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Recovery Numbers"
  description="Recovery Numbers provides free, instant legal and financial calculators for personal injury, workers' comp, debt relief, and family law."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>About Recovery Numbers</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Free calculators for settlement, debt relief, and family law situations.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="card" style="max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>Recovery Numbers provides free, instant calculators that help people understand the rough value of their legal and financial situations — personal injury settlements, workers' compensation, debt relief options, child support, and more.</p>

    <h2>How estimates are calculated</h2>
    <p>Each tool uses publicly documented methods — the injury multiplier method, percentage-of-income child support guidelines, scheduled-loss workers' comp tables, and the federal means test formula. We document our methodology on the <a href="/methodology/">Methodology page</a>.</p>

    <h2>What we are not</h2>
    <p>Recovery Numbers is not a law firm and does not provide legal or financial advice. Our tools produce rough estimates for informational purposes only. Consult a licensed attorney or financial advisor before making any legal or financial decision.</p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>We do not collect or store any data you enter into our calculators. All calculations run entirely in your browser. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
